    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are delighted to present \"Lagile Lodge\", an impressive detached family residence extending to approximately 2,165 sq. ft. (201 sq. m.), occupying a beautifully mature and exceptionally private site on the edge of Killeagh village.\r\nConstructed in 1991 and meticulously maintained throughout, this substantial four-bedroom home offers an outstanding balance of spacious family accommodation, mature landscaped gardens and exceptional outdoor facilities. Enjoying a desirable south-east orientation, the property is filled with natural light and perfectly positioned within walking distance of Killeagh village while remaining just minutes from the beautiful East Cork coastline.\r\nExternally, the property is equally impressive. Mature landscaped gardens surround the residence, creating an exceptional sense of privacy, while a substantial double-height block-built garage, three adjoining block-built stables, enclosed yard, orchard and paddock provide endless opportunities for equestrian enthusiasts, hobby farmers, those operating a business from home or buyers seeking extensive workshop and storage space.\r\nKilleagh Village, Glenbower Woods and the Midleton-Youghal Greenway are at the door step. Ideally located, just five minutes from Youghal's beaches and boardwalk, Lagile Lodge combines peaceful countryside living with everyday convenience. Cork City is approximately 35 minutes away.Accommodation Summary: Reception Hallway · Guest WC · Sitting Room · Living Room · Sunroom · Kitchen/Dining Room · Pantry · Utility Room · Office · Four Double Bedrooms (all ensuite, 3 with walk-in wardrobes) — extending in total to approximately 2,165 sq. ft. (201 sq. m.).\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €695, 000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Room by Room\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\nReception Hallway:                 A spacious, welcoming entrance with tiled flooring.\r\nGuest W.C.:                                 W.C., wash hand basin and tiled flooring.\r\nSitting Room:                             A bright, dual-aspect reception room with solid          timber flooring, a feature open fireplace and a dining area.\r\nSunroom:                                      A beautiful south facing room with terracotta tiled flooring and double doors opening directly onto the patio and gardens.\r\nLiving Room                                 Features a fireplace with stove; leads through to the sunroom and kitchen.\r\nKitchen / Dining Room         Cream-painted fitted kitchen with integrated dishwasher and fridge, gas hob, electric oven and tiled flooring.\r\nPantry:                                           Excellent additional storage adjoining the kitchen.\r\nUtility Room:                             Fitted units with sink; washing machine, dryer and freezer included.\r\nOffice:                                           An ideal work-from-home space with solid timber flooring.\r\nFirst Floor\r\nMaster Bedroom:                    A generous dual-aspect bedroom.\r\nWalk-in Wardrobe:                Generous storage space.\r\nEn-Suite:                                      Bath, shower, W.C. and wash hand basin.\r\nBedroom 2:                                 Double bedroom with ensuite (W.C., wash hand basin and shower).\r\nBedroom 3:                                 Double bedroom with ensuite (W.C., wash hand basin and shower) and walk-in wardrobe.\r\nBedroom 4:                                 Double bedroom with ensuite (W.C., wash hand basin and shower) and walk-in wardrobe.\r\nHot Press:                                    Large, shelved hot press with insulated hot water cylinder.\r\n\r\nOutside:    \tThe property is approached through mature gardens and enjoys an exceptionally private setting, with a sunny, south facing patio overlooking beautifully established lawns.\r\n                                                           A substantial double-height, block-built garage offers outstanding storage and workshop potential, while three adjoining stables (12ft x 12ft), an enclosed yard, an orchard and an adjoining paddock make this an ideal property for equestrian enthusiasts or those seeking a smallholding lifestyle.\r\n                                                           Secure gated access leads directly to the paddock and orchard beyond, while mature planting provides privacy throughout the grounds."
      },
